# Third-party files the site serves as they came, each pinned by SHA-256
# (paths relative to site/), checked before every build by
# scripts/check-vendored.sh. A file here is never edited; a new version is
# a new download, verified against its source, and a new line. The comment
# above each line names the version, the source and the licence.
