# the registry's dist.integrity). MIT, assets/lib/mermaid/LICENSE; the
# bundle's own licence comments name what it bundles (site/NOTICE). Pinned
# to 11.x on purpose: Hextra v0.13.0's scripts/mermaid.html drives the 11.x
# initialize/run API, and 12.x is unchecked against it.
